Recently, we have gotten some performance issues with LMW. So to decrease
memory load we disabled several extensions listed here:
https://github.com/lojban/lmw/issues/1
https://github.com/lojban/lmw/issues/2
https://github.com/lojban/lmw/issues/3

If you really need one of those extensions please let us know. Also you may
subscribe to this github repository by pressing "watch" and/or post new
issues there. It's supposed to be the official bug tracker of the wiki.

Posting questions and issues here is still fine of course.


